      "body": "Concept ACK. The 8x32 backend has the same temporary: `secp256k1_scalar_mul` in `scalar_8x32_impl.h` keeps the 512-bit product in `l[16]` and does not clear it. That backend is the one used on 32-bit targets without a 128-bit integer type, so the second commit could clear `l` there as well.\n",
